        "MINER_TYPHOONUNLOCKABLE_ACHIEVEMENT_DESC": "Ut Miner, ludum vince aut te oblitera in Typhoon aut Eclipse.\n<color=#8888>(Difficultas Typhoon postulat Starstorm 2)</color>",
